        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2801-09, Modern Brass Series 6-1/2\" Towel Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 6-1/2 Inch Towel Ring is a stylish way to display your bathroom hand towels.  Available in six popular finish colors, it is a great choice for modern and contemporary bathroom remodels. This Modern Brass Towel Ring is easy to install and comes packaged with all necessary mounting hardware. This hand towel ring is made of solid brass for long-lasting durability against the challenges of a humid bathroom environment.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-toilet-tissue-holder-emtek-2804-09-1214671\"><b>Modern Toilet Tissue Holder</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-brass-towel-bar-emtek-28024-09-1214667\"><b>Modern Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/modern-double-robe-hook-emtek-2809-09-1214669\"><b>Modern Double Robe Hook</b></a>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Bathroom Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Ring Dimensions: 3/8\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-5/8 \"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Disc Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-280109-installation.pdf?v=1718159562\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Brass Towel Ring Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-280109-specifications.pdf?v=1718159604\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Modern Brass Towel Ring Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel ring and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
